WEBVTT

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.800
And now for our feature presentation.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.920
In the decades after mankind's swollen population began overflowing into outer space,

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.620
hundreds of gigantic colonies were constructed in Earth's orbit.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:53.600
Within their cylindrical walls, man tried to recreate his old environment as a new homeland for the human race.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:58.390
Generations were born, lived, and died within these man-made worlds.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:01:59.900
Here they thrived.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.840
peaceful contentment until the year 0079 of the Universal Century.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:18.260
Having bestowed upon themselves the title of the Duchy of Zeon, the colonies of the furthest

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:23.720
outside orbit known as Side 3 launched a war of independence against the Federated Union

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:24.180
of Earth.

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:29.840
Mankind was horrified as the first month of fighting saw both sides lose half of their

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:29.960
We'll be right back.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.860
populations. The bitter carnage has raged on for eight months with no resolution in sight.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:49.700
Under these unthinkable nightmare conditions, the continuing existence of humankind itself

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.440
is very much in question.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:59.940
are set up in sector 19 nothing's stirring now no troops in sight anyway

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:06.180
