difficult for you to do but you must be needed on the bridge if you keep this up you're going

01:10:24.240 --> 01:10:28.120
to regret it for the rest of your life i thought you'd welcome the opportunity to settle your

01:10:28.120 --> 01:10:29.780
score with Char, but I guess I over-

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:31.680
you. Come on, Frau Boe.

01:10:32.480 --> 01:10:34.620
Shah? Huh? Hey, Noah,

01:10:34.840 --> 01:10:36.620
wait! Noah!

